  "duration": 59800000,
  "fps": 30,
  "materials": {
    "videos": [
      {
        "id": "0e2b5b05-8400-4481-9246-165d8d29bf11",
        "path": "E:\\代码\\美食街\\live-cutter\\recordings\\20-48-18_东方甄选_p024.mp4",
        "type": "video",
        "duration": 3600000000,
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 1920
      }
    ],
    "texts": [
      {
        "id": "fb0b7479-511c-4dea-b02c-eab393f72d33",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"东西,盖在上面,你用把温度开的特别高,这种就是不安全的了\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "bd3cbc64-24b6-4065-a1e9-2e877c092999",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"但是我跟大家说了,咱们的这个设计是怎么回事\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "49190d89-6e76-4ba7-aa1d-ce62f4089147",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"它是到温度,如果70度,中间这层相交就融了\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "0a80b2fc-3565-4ab5-a412-4082dcea3005",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"70度左右就融了,融了之后,外面这个线跟礼本的这个发热这个线就对上了\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "61bcab62-bc02-45a7-9106-f9e26cc2179f",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"它拿着一接受上,就断电保护了\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "de73c6d7-e7e6-46e1-9db9-3bb279887554",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"所以也不用担心什么这个引发这个火情问题,但是的话就你电产就费了,能理解吧\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "041de654-be9a-4b93-857d-7d73d011dab0",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"所以我跟大家说,你温度开到高功率没事,开到那个所谓的高党没事\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "dc304503-3d48-483f-9cd7-46bc57fb6782",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"但是你上面别干那种不透气,有特别沉的东西就行了,是这样拿\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "adc21fc2-2564-4eca-a45b-4f859478d40e",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"所以朋友们,上面能放电在,你看我们这不就放着了吗?\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "0b1cca6a-8b6a-4ace-8100-5ed82852349a",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"你这上面现在放小入子,放床单,该背子都没事\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "165c0150-8641-4463-9d4b-142c1f780ec6",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"咱们这是40多年的大牌子,朋友们,40争的大牌子,各位朋友们,放心去看\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "35cb0104-cc80-4a6a-9e94-92a8fff2eceb",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"然后跟大家再讲一下,咱们的这个今天给大家为什么要做这样那个专场\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "77e25efe-ef82-433d-919c-e554ef7814b4",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"因为真是天儿愿来愿冷了,朋友们\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "4df6586b-f656-4fa2-b88e-807381afb3c7",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"不,我在交代人家,这个没交你\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      }
    ],
